{"paraphrase_id": "PARA-CORE-001-1", "source_case_id": "CASE-CORE-001", "source_user_prompt_id": "UP-CORE-001", "language": "ko-KR", "text": "지금 선택한 Boreal 갱신 메일을 다시 확인해서 서명 마감과 법무 담당을 보여줘. 다른 메일 검색은 하지 말아줘.", "source_path": "evaluation/datasets/agent/prompts/finalist-paraphrases-v1.14-r8.4.jsonl#PARA-CORE-001-1"}
{"paraphrase_id": "PARA-CORE-001-2", "source_case_id": "CASE-CORE-001", "source_user_prompt_id": "UP-CORE-001", "language": "en-US", "text": "Re-check the selected Boreal renewal email and show me the final signing deadline and legal owner. Don't search any other emails.", "source_path": "evaluation/datasets/agent/prompts/finalist-paraphrases-v1.14-r8.4.jsonl#PARA-CORE-001-2"}
